  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review the implementation of the EU4SGR budget support contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objective of this framework contract is to provide a detailed review of the implementation of the EU Sector Reform Performance Contract - EU 4 Sustainable Governance and Resilience (EU4SGR) in Georgia and to enable the Commission to use the submitted reports as a tool for monitoring programme execution and taking decisions on instalment disbursement for the years 2023, 2024 and 2026.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
